"WHAT_IS" = "What is ListApp?";
"ABOUT_WHAT" = "ListApp transforms your iOS device by completely replacing the standard Home Screen with an elegant Settings-like vertical list. Each app is presented in an individual elongated liquid glass pill taking up 2/3 of the screen width, centered on screen.";
"HOW_IT_WORKS" = "How It Works";
"ABOUT_HOW" = "ListApp injects directly into SpringBoard's root folder hierarchy, fetching installed applications dynamically without querying private network endpoints. App launches use system-level application workspaces with multiple failover tiers for 100% stability.";
"FEATURE_LIST" = "Key Features";
"ABOUT_FEATURES" = "• Replaces stock Home Screen upon unlock\n• Each app enclosed in a 2/3 screen width elongated liquid glass pill\n• Centered horizontally on the screen, scrolling vertically from top to bottom\n• iOS 26+ style specular refraction reflection and continuous squircles\n• Ultra-fast live search bar with instantaneous filtering\n• Tactile haptic feedback on app touches\n• Options to hide classic stock icons, dock, and page dots\n• Automatic circuit breaker crash protection\n• 3 package architectures: Rootful, Rootless, and RootHide";
"COMPAT" = "Compatibility";
"ABOUT_COMPAT" = "iOS 15.0 through iOS 27.x.\nSupported architectures:\n• iphoneos-arm (Rootful)\n• iphoneos-arm64 (Rootless - Dopamine, Palera1n)\n• iphoneos-arm64e (RootHide)\nCompatible with ElleKit, Substitute, and MobileSubstrate.";
"ABOUT_SAFETY" = "ListApp respects system sandbox policies, never modifies system system binaries, and includes defensive exception isolation.";
